      "id": "claim_5484cd72c0fc49a1be3ca1b5b001ba76",
      "statement": "Spotless (3.10.4) is configured once in the root POM's pluginManagement and inherited by all four module trees (root, core, tlr, inconsistency-detection); its Java formatting uses the tree-local formatter.xml Eclipse profile, removes unused imports, enforces the license-header template, applies the java/javax/org/com import order from spotless.importorder, sorts POMs (sortPom), and ratchets all checks with ratchetFrom origin/main so only files changed relative to origin/main are checked or rewritten.",
