      "id": "claim_54d5074fc448402cac1e584b1d2a899b",
      "statement": "The Format workflow enforces Spotless by auto-fix rather than failure: on pull requests to main (and manual dispatch) it checks out with full history (fetch-depth: 0, required by the ratchet), probes the POM for the Java major version, runs mvn -B spotless:apply, and auto-commits the reformat as 'Apply formatting changes' via git-auto-commit-action; Spotless is not bound to any Maven lifecycle phase, so mvn clean verify does not run it.",
