      "statement": "org.codehaus.mojo:flatten-maven-plugin is pinned to exactly 1.9.0 in the root pluginManagement because 1.8.0's CI-friendly interpolator threw an NPE against this POM (mojohaus/flatten-maven-plugin#523), fixed in 1.9.0; it runs with flattenMode=resolveCiFriendliesOnly and updatePomFile=true, expands dependencyManagement and dependencies, and executes at the clean and process-resources phases so deployed POMs carry fully resolved versions instead of ${revision} placeholders.",
