      "statement": "The ArchUnit suites live in core/tests-base/src/main (not src/test) with compile-scoped archunit-junit5 so other modules consume them on their test classpath; tests-base itself has no test tree so the rules never execute there, and they are re-enabled only through @AnalyzeClasses test subclasses in tests-tlr (analyzing edu.kit.kastel.mcse.ardoco.core + .tlr) and tests-inconsistency (analyzing core + tlr + id), so the same rules are re-evaluated against each tree's classpath.",
