    {
      "id": "claim_0c359525c3ec41fe86e73d7ac37164e2",
      "statement": "The layerRule in ArchitectureTest defines ten layers with may-only-be-accessed-by restrictions mirroring the pipeline data flow: Common (..common.., ..data.., ..api.., ..tests..), Pipeline (..pipeline..), and CodeTraceability (..codetraceability..) are unrestricted access targets; Execution (..execution..) may only be accessed by Common (needed for tests); InconsistencyDetection (..inconsistency.., ..id..) only by Pipeline, Common, and Execution; ConnectionGenerator only by CodeTraceability, InconsistencyDetection, Pipeline, Common, Execution, and Artemis; RecommendationGenerator only by ConnectionGenerator, InconsistencyDetection, Pipeline, Common, and Execution; TextExtractor and ModelExtractor by the downstream stages plus Pipeline, Common, Execution, and Artemis; and Artemis (..artemis..) only by ConnectionGenerator, Pipeline, Execution, Common, InconsistencyDetection, and CodeTraceability.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://core/tests-base/src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/core/tests/architecture/ArchitectureTest.java#L81-L122",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8f5e042c773dde470082247272bc08b19bf257ceadd3d72200cd0f117395a2e6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_81e3f8f1b3f548ef821edfd710bcd43c",
      "statement": "ArchitectureTest pins stage ordering and naming with five sibling rules: noDependencyOnExecution (..execution.. may only be depended on by execution and tests code), modelInstancesOnlyAfterModelExtraction (classes named Model usable only from model, recommendation, connection, inconsistency/id, pipeline, common, output, tests, and artemis packages), linksOnlyAfterConnectionGenerator (*Link classes consumable only by connection-generator, code-traceability, trace-link, inconsistency, id, pipeline, common, api, tests, and artemis packages), usingLinkAsNamingOnlyInConnectionGenerator (*Link-named classes may reside only in tracelink, codetraceability, and connectiongenerator packages), and inconsistencyOnlyAfterInconsistencyDetection (Inconsistency-named classes usable only by inconsistency, id, execution, api, common, and tests packages).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://core/tests-base/src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/core/tests/architecture/ArchitectureTest.java#L46-L79",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7b191b18fc640c8aad12838e80c89fecb6b9c90e05fa9f40eab79ca8d7529dbf:"
        }
      ]
