    {
      "id": "claim_167aedcd5140475d915819af16ea0b20",
      "statement": "The noGetEnv rule forbids every class except edu.kit.kastel.mcse.ardoco.core.common.util.Environment from calling System.getenv() or System.getenv(String), making Environment the single environment-variable gateway; Environment loads a .env file from the working directory once at class initialization via io.github.cdimascio:dotenv-java, and getEnv(key) returns the .env value first (a .env entry beats the system environment), falls back to System.getenv, and returns null when missing; getEnvNonNull(key) logs an error for missing variables but still returns null rather than throwing.",
