          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b85332fbbaf8351a45798b961105c597b2279db53dbb72f555f26d5266bffd46:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_78723d70936c49a6b0da3993b3c10106",
      "statement": "DeterministicArdocoTest also enforces equality/sorting coherence: ensureContractBetweenEqualsHashCodeAndCompareTo requires classes directly implementing Comparable (that are not enums, interfaces, or anonymous classes) to implement both equals and hashCode, and ensureSortedCollectionsOnlyForComparableTypes plus its field/return variants require sorted collection fields (SortedMap, Immutable/MutableSortedMap, SortedSet, Immutable/MutableSortedSet) and sorted-collection return types to be parameterized with Comparable element types.",
