        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2d3bb2020c5b451686bf7fa25b27d11b",
      "statement": "ConfigurationHelper (pipeline-core, @Deterministic) feeds the contract: loadAdditionalConfigs(File) parses UTF-8 override files with one KEY=VALUE line each (blank lines skipped, malformed lines logged), and getDefaultConfigurationOptions() scans all concrete non-test AbstractConfigurable subclasses under edu.kit.kastel.mcse.ardoco with Reflections, instantiates each via ConfigurationInstantiatorUtils.createObject (trying no-arg, (Map), (DataRepository), (String, DataRepository) constructors in order), and records every @Configurable field's default as a string (Double as %f English locale, List<String> comma-joined, enums by name); per-class extraction failures are logged at debug and the class skipped. ConfigurationTestBase (bound to JUnit by a ConfigurationTest in each test tree) validates that @Configurable fields are neither final nor static and prints the full default map as a key=value configuration file.",
