      "statement": "The root POM binds maven-failsafe-plugin (goals integration-test + verify at the integration-test phase) in pluginManagement, and the two test modules bind it, so mvn clean verify runs the ArchUnit/configuration suites under Surefire and the benchmark/evaluation integration tests under Failsafe in one build; a violated ArchUnit or configuration rule is a Surefire failure that fails the build, while Spotless violations are fixed by the Format workflow's bot commit.",
